"在 FBWA 模式下，以 0.01 为增量增大 "
"P。通过快速角度输入来检查每次变化，保持然后释放。在另一方向上做同样操作。您希望飞机快速平滑地移动到新角度，然后再返回，无过冲或海豚式摆动。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:129
#: 8d3e6e9fed8b46d7a8a4fa1925a0e664
msgid ""
"When you get pitch angle oscillation or overshoot, then you need to reduce P"
" by 25-50%."
msgstr "当出现俯仰角震荡或过冲时，需要将 P 减少 25-50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:131
#: 82bdd1c5ebe2466cad640c32316c9ea8
msgid ""
"Increase the D gain in increments of 0.001 until it it starts to oscillate, "
"then halve it. Be sure to check the temperature of your servos when you land"
" as in extreme cases turning up this gain can cause rapid servo movement and"
" overheat the servos leading to premature failure."
msgstr ""
"以 0.001 为增量增大 D "
"增益，直到开始震荡，然后减半。落地后请务必检查舵机温度，因为在极端情况下提高此增益可能导致快速舵机运动并使舵机过热，导致过早故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:135
#: 96c81819787a4688afa0a154780d10ce
msgid "You can sometimes then go back and increase P gain a bit more."
msgstr "有时之后可以再次适当增大 P 增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:138
#: 975adca3a7de41aca96b1d4cdd4b28ae
msgid "ACRO YAW Rate Controller Tuning"
msgstr "ACRO 偏航速率控制器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:140
#: deb768b1c15541ec8ccb56108e766477
msgid ""
"As of version 4.2, a full YAW rate controller for use in ACRO mode is also "
"provided. ``YAW_RATE_x`` parameters exist and can be adjusted after "
":ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` is set to 1. When enabled, the "
":ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` parameter can be used to adjust maximum "
"yaw rate demanded at rudder stick full deflections in ACRO mode."
msgstr ""
"从 4.2 版本起，还提供了用于 ACRO 模式的完整偏航速率控制器。``YAW_RATE_x`` 参数存在，可在 "
":ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` 设为 1 "
"后调整。启用后，:ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` 参数可用于调整 ACRO 模式下方向舵摇杆全偏时的最大偏航速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:142
#: cfb17ead8dc34e759a02b3bafe59a514
msgid ""
"Manual tuning adjustment follows the same methodology as explained above for"
" the pitch and roll axes. PID parameters can also be AutoTuned in the same "
"manner as those for the pitch and roll axes."
msgstr "手动调参调整遵循上述俯仰和横滚轴相同的方法。PID 参数也可以以与俯仰和横滚轴相同的方式进行 AutoTuning。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:144
#: ab8e3b6955f84bd298af623121e287c7
msgid ""
"this is different than the YAW damper/sideslip controller provided for "
"stabilized flight modes. See :ref:`yaw-controller-tuning` below."
msgstr "这与稳定飞行模式提供的偏航阻尼/侧滑控制器不同。参见下方 :ref:`yaw-controller-tuning`。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:147
#: 35f7cc27d75b4d4ebabdb1fed9cbf88d
msgid "Roll to Pitch Compensation"
msgstr "横滚到俯仰补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:149
#: feee38b9104c43d3b15ded325bd7260a
msgid ""
"Another tuning parameter is :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` which "
"compensates pitch in turns to avoid altitude loss due to loss of lift caused"
" by the roll. To set this:"
msgstr ""
"另一个调参参数是 :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>`，用于在转弯中补偿俯仰，以避免因横滚造成升力损失而掉高。设置方法："

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:151
#: 3b2a754cbe5943229e50c5093e30ea8d
msgid ""
"Roll the model to maximum bank in each direction. The nose should stay "
"fairly level during the turns without significant gain or loss of altitude. "
"Some loss of altitude during sustained turns at constant throttle is "
"expected, because the extra drag of turning slows the model down which will "
"cause a mild descent. If the model gains height during the turns then you "
"need to reduce the :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` by small increments of "
"0.05 from the default value of 1.0. If the model descends immediately when "
"the model banks (a mild descent later in the turn when the model slows down "
"is normal as explained earlier) default value of 1.0. If you need to change "
"the :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` parameter outside the range from 0.7 "
"to 1.4 then something is likely wrong with either the earlier tuning of your"
" pitch loop, your airspeed calibration or your autopilot's bank angle "
"estimate."
msgstr ""
"将飞机向每个方向滚转到最大坡度。转弯中机头应保持相对水平，没有明显的高度获得或损失。在恒定油门的持续转弯中预期会有一些高度损失，因为转弯的额外阻力会使飞机减速导致轻微下沉。如果飞机在转弯时获得高度，需要以"
" 0.05 为步长减小 :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` 的默认值 "
"1.0。如果飞机在倾斜时立即下沉（在转弯后期因飞机减速导致的轻微下沉是正常的，如前所述），则为默认值 1.0。如果需要将 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RLL<PTCH2SRV_RLL>` 参数更改到 0.7 至 1.4 "
"范围之外，则可能是俯仰环的早期调参、空速校准或飞控坡度角估计存在问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:167
#: e9eb601a8fd2476899b1d52ff10fd67e
msgid "Tuning tips"
msgstr "调参技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:169
#: 814f52593a0a4d2f87834e1a1640aa25
msgid ""
"Select the tuning box on the bottom of the Mission Planners Flight Data "
"page. You should get a scrolling black window above the map. Double click in"
" the black window and you should get a list of parameters to plot. Change "
"the selection until you have the pitch and nav_pitch plotted. Nav_pitch is "
"the demand and pitch is the response. You can use this to look for overshoot"
" and other behaviour that isn't so obvious from the ground looking at the "
"model."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据页面底部选择调参框。您应该在地图上方看到一个滚动的黑色窗口。在黑色窗口中双击，应该看到要绘制的参数列表。更改选择，直到显示 pitch 和 "
"nav_pitch 的图表。Nav_pitch 是期望值，pitch 是响应值。您可以用此查找过冲和其他从地面看飞机不那么明显的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:176
#: 2b69bea196134e6e9b2e92004644800c
msgid ""
"Although the autopilot will prevent the integrator from increasing if the "
"maximum elevator is exceeded, there is additional protection provided by the"
" :ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` parameter. This parameter sets the "
"maximum amount of elevator that the integrator can control. The default "
"value of 0.666 allows the integrator to trim up to 2/3 of the total elevator"
" travel. This should be enough to allow for the trim offset and variation in"
" trim with speed for most models."
msgstr ""
"尽管飞控会在超过最大升降舵时阻止积分器增加，但 :ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` "
"参数提供了额外保护。此参数设置积分器可控制的最大升降舵量。默认值 0.666 允许积分器修正最多 2/3 "
"的总升降舵行程。这对大多数飞机来说应该足以允许配平偏移和速度配平变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:183
#: 840a314a18bc4d80b4aec09dd2bc2681
msgid ""
"WARNING : If :ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` is set too high, then "
"there is a danger that in FBWA, if the model has been leveled so that zero "
"pitch is too nose-up to glide at a safe speed, that the integrator will "
"continue to keep increasing the elevator to maintain the demanded pitch "
"angle until the model stalls. :ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` should "
"be set to a value that is big enough to allow from trim changes, but small "
"enough so that it cannot stall the plane. The default for Plane is 2/3 of "
"total throw, which could produce this problem."
msgstr ""
"警告：如果 :ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>` 设置过高，则在 FBWA "
"模式下存在危险，即如果飞机调平后零俯仰角时机速不足以安全滑翔，积分器将继续增大升降舵以维持期望俯仰角直到飞机失速。:ref:`PTCH_RATE_IMAX<PTCH_RATE_IMAX>`"
" 应设置为足够大以允许配平变化，但足够小以防止飞机失速。Plane 的默认值为总行程的 2/3，可能产生此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:191
#: 55c7f29efaac40d59f6fa22560d8a032
msgid ""
"Be sure that :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` is setup to add "
"negative pitch at low throttle in stabilized modes."
msgstr "确保 :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` 已设置为在增稳模式低油门时增加负俯仰（低头）。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:193
#: 6779941c84d04af6baa56643b2a096c0
msgid ""
"The rate of pitch (and therefore the reduce the number of g's) used to "
"correct pitch angle errors can be limited setting the pitch rate limit "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` and "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` parameters to non-zero values. "
"Setting these values to 560 divided by the airspeed (in metres/second) gives"
" a limit equivalent to approximately +- 1g."
msgstr ""
"用于修正俯仰角误差的俯仰速率（因此减少 g 值）可以通过将俯仰速率限制 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` 和 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` 参数设为非零值来限制。将这些值设为 560 "
"除以空速（米/秒）给出的限制大约等于 +/-1g。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:198
#: b412a42a39594aeb966157916da2d114
msgid ""
"The time constant parameter :ref:`PTCH2SRV_TCONST<PTCH2SRV_TCONST>` can also"
" be used to adjust how rapidly the pitch angle reaches the demanded value. "
"The effect of this parameter will be seen mostly in the response to small "
"step changes in demanded pitch. For larger pitch demands, the pitch rate "
"limits :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` and "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` tend to mask its effect. Making "
"this parameter smaller will cause the aircraft to reach its demanded pitch "
"angle in less time, but only if the aircraft is capable. A very slow "
"responding airframe may require a slightly larger setting for this "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"时间常数参数 :ref:`PTCH2SRV_TCONST<PTCH2SRV_TCONST>` "
"也可用于调整俯仰角达到指令值的速度。此参数的效果主要体现在对指令俯仰的小阶跃变化响应上。对于较大的俯仰指令，俯仰速率限制 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>` 和 "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP>` "
"往往会掩盖其效果。减小此参数将使飞机在更短时间内达到指令俯仰角，但前提是飞机有能力实现。响应非常缓慢的机架可能需要稍大的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:207
#: e21a47fbdd9e4643804b143cf74cf4a8
msgid ""
"Plot the pitch_speed in the tuning window. This shows the rate of pitch in "
"radians/second. A value of 1 radian/second is approximately equal to 60 "
"degrees/second (57 to be more precise), so if for example you had \\ "
":ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>`/UP set to 30, the maximum "
"pitch_speed when responding to a large pitch angle demand (eg full pitch one"
" way to full pitch the other way) should be just above 0.5."
msgstr ""
"在调参窗口中绘制 pitch_speed。这显示了以弧度/秒为单位的俯仰速率。1 弧度/秒约等于 60 度/秒（更精确地说是 57 度），因此例如如果将"
" :ref:`PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN<PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN>`/UP 设为 "
"30，在响应大幅俯仰角需求时（例如从最大俯仰到最大反向俯仰）的最大 pitch_speed 应略高于 0.5。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:215
#: a05b78c64bc04824a8ca42960b316441
msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "滤波"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:217
#: 533f054476524e6581710d04c858b521
msgid ""
"The new PID-FF controller in Plane also has a number of lowpass filters "
"whose frequencies can be adjusted. The defaults should be satisfactory, "
"however, experimentation on these may yield better response to external "
"disturbances in certain situations, or when special requirements, such as "
"video filming would suggest lowering the responsiveness as a trade-off for "
"increased smoothness. These are:"
msgstr ""
"Plane 中新的 PID-FF "
"控制器还具有多个低通滤波器，其频率可以调整。默认值应令人满意，但在某些情况下对这些进行试验可能会对外部扰动产生更好的响应，或在视频拍摄等特殊需求建议以增加平滑度为代价降低响应性时使用。这些参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:219
#: c1fb4dfe121248d3b090666f54419e08
msgid ""
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_FLTT<PTCH_RATE_FLTT>`: filter on target demanded pitch rate"
msgstr ":ref:`PTCH_RATE_FLTT<PTCH_RATE_FLTT>`：目标期望俯仰速率滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:220
#: 8ed824af318441908623959016cf3ce7
msgid ":ref:`PTCH_RATE_FLTE<PTCH_RATE_FLTE>`: filter on pitch rate error"
msgstr ":ref:`PTCH_RATE_FLTE<PTCH_RATE_FLTE>`：俯仰速率误差滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:221
#: cb7c11e99482458988dc269b11947f1d
msgid ""
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_FLTD<PTCH_RATE_FLTD>`: filter on D term (tends to be noisy)"
msgstr ":ref:`PTCH_RATE_FLTD<PTCH_RATE_FLTD>`：D 项滤波器（通常噪声较大）"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:222
#: 8deda7b77547419db5b9f2046cc97f4c
msgid ""
":ref:`RLL_RATE_FLTT<RLL_RATE_FLTT>`: filter on target demanded roll rate"
msgstr ":ref:`RLL_RATE_FLTT<RLL_RATE_FLTT>`：目标期望横滚速率滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:223
#: c4c0657b546744fd917335e8e4beba0f
msgid ":ref:`RLL_RATE_FLTE<RLL_RATE_FLTE>`: filter on roll rate error"
msgstr ":ref:`RLL_RATE_FLTE<RLL_RATE_FLTE>`：横滚速率误差滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:224
#: 930460a6ca8d48ed9deb9fe6b58c942b
msgid ""
":ref:`RLL_RATE_FLTD<RLL_RATE_FLTD>`: filter on D term (tends to be noisy)"
msgstr ":ref:`RLL_RATE_FLTD<RLL_RATE_FLTD>`：D 项滤波器（通常噪声较大）"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:227
#: f43ddf22a6d04ab0b66d8f92898a2f79
msgid "Speed Scaling (SS)"
msgstr "速度缩放（SS）"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:229
#: 3ab961fb1b4c446c8233827e941230a2
msgid ""
"ArduPilot automatically adjusts the stabilization gains in the PID-FF loops "
"based on the airspeed. This helps avoid oscillations when flying fast and "
"ensures effective stabilization during slower flight, even if the aircraft "
"doesn't have an airspeed sensor. This parameter is "
":ref:`SCALING_SPEED<SCALING_SPEED>`. This should be set close to the normal "
"cruising speed of the aircraft. The loop gains are scaled above and below "
"this value with a multiplier determined base on the above min  and max "
"flying speeds. These parameters are :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` and "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`, respectively. See :ref:`airspeed-"
"parameters-setup` for more details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 根据空速自动调整 PID-FF "
"环中的稳定增益。这有助于避免高速飞行时的震荡，并确保低速飞行时的有效稳定，即使飞机没有空速传感器。此参数为 "
":ref:`SCALING_SPEED<SCALING_SPEED>`，应设置为接近飞机正常巡航速度。环增益在此值上下根据上述最小和最大飞行速度确定的乘数进行缩放。这些参数分别是"
" :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`。更多详情请参见 :ref:`airspeed-parameters-setup`。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:238
#: 83d05363f0c74b6f999190c4283e27bc
msgid ""
"Changing this parameter after tuning will affect your controller settings, "
"and can cause poor performance of your aircraft. If you change the "
"SCALING_SPEED after completing a tune, you must re-run AUTOTUNE or manually "
"retune the controller gains."
msgstr ""
"调参完成后更改此参数将影响您的控制器设置，可能导致飞机性能不佳。如果在完成调参后更改了 SCALING_SPEED，必须重新运行 AUTOTUNE "
"或手动重新调参控制器增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:242
#: 8a14113eb54143e0977ab280762f9135
msgid "Slew Rate Limiter"
msgstr "斜率速率限制器"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:244
#: 90636046a012425090cb855f8538fc3b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes an algorithm that monitors the actuator slew rates. If "
"the rates exceed the thresholds defined by the _SMAX parameters, it "
"automatically reduces the control loop gains to help stop the oscillations. "
"One can set the slew rate limits for the pitch and roll control surfaces "
"using the following parameters: :ref:`PTCH_RATE_SMAX<PTCH_RATE_SMAX>` for "
"pitch and :ref:`RLL_RATE_SMAX<RLL_RATE_SMAX>` for roll. See :ref:`common-"
"servo-limit-cycle-detection` for more details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 包含一个监测执行器斜率速率的算法。如果速率超过 _SMAX "
"参数定义的阈值，它会自动降低控制环增益以帮助停止震荡。可以使用以下参数设置俯仰和横滚控制舵面的斜率速率限制：俯仰用 "
":ref:`PTCH_RATE_SMAX<PTCH_RATE_SMAX>`，横滚用 "
":ref:`RLL_RATE_SMAX<RLL_RATE_SMAX>`。更多详情请参见 :ref:`common-servo-limit-cycle-"
"detection`。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:250
#: da0816cf95bd49d792ded3d392e40cf2
msgid "PID Controller Flow Diagram"
msgstr "PID 控制器流程图"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:257
#: ec0a9346a31143eb9cdcb56c2f4db60e
msgid "Yaw Damper/SideSlip Tuning"
msgstr "偏航阻尼/侧滑调参"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:259
#: d9c95ab2fbb442bead53c4401e9a79ae
msgid ""
"The yaw control loop can be configured either as a simple yaw damper (good "
"for models with inadequate fin area) or as a combined yaw damper and side-"
"slip controller. Because control of side-slip uses measured lateral "
"acceleration, it will only work for those models that have enough fuselage "
"side area to produce a measurable lateral acceleration when they side-slip "
"(an extreme example of this is an aerobatic model flying a knife-edge "
"maneuver where all of the lift is produced by the fuselage). Gliders with "
"slender fuselages and flying wings cannot use this feature, but can still "
"benefit from the yaw damper provided they have a yaw control (rudder, "
"differential airbrakes, etc)"
msgstr ""
"偏航控制环可以配置为简单的偏航阻尼器（适用于垂尾面积不足的飞机），或组合偏航阻尼器和侧滑控制器。由于侧滑控制使用测量的侧向加速度，它只适用于机身侧面面积足够大、侧滑时能产生可测量侧向加速度的飞机（极端例子是飞机以刀锋飞行时，所有升力由机身产生）。具有细长机身的滑翔机和飞翼无法使用此功能，但如果它们有偏航控制（方向舵、差动减速板等），仍可从偏航阻尼器中获益。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:271
#: c65ab7e2646741baa98327c883e044d2
msgid "Tuning the yaw damper"
msgstr "偏航阻尼器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:273
#: 1952e714857c4323b8f63c2c53242a34
msgid ""
"Verify that the :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` and "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` gain terms are set to zero, the "
"``YAW2SRV_RLL`` gain term is set to 1.0 and the "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>` gain term is set to zero"
msgstr ""
"验证 :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` 和 :ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` "
"增益项设为零，``YAW2SRV_RLL`` 增益项设为 1.0，:ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>` 增益项设为零"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:276
#: 7d4f564096b143adb24737f72eb6c362
msgid ""
"Now rapidly roll the model from maximum bank angle in one direction to "
"maximum bank angle in the opposite direction. Do this several times going in"
" each direction and observe the yawing motion of the model. If as the wings "
"pass through level the nose is yawed in the opposite direction to the roll "
"(for example when rolling from left to right bank, the nose points left) "
"then increase the value of :ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` gain until the "
"yaw goes away. Do not use a value larger than 1."
msgstr ""
"现在快速将飞机从一侧最大坡度滚转到另一侧最大坡度。在每个方向重复多次，观察飞机的偏航运动。如果机翼过水平位置时机头向横滚的反方向偏航（例如从左横滚到右横滚时机头向左），则增大"
" :ref:`KFF_RDDRMIX<KFF_RDDRMIX>` 增益直到偏航消失。不要使用大于 1 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:284
#: 182625778152464fbf00b5e11fa77b71
msgid ""
"Increase :ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>` in small increments of 0.05 until"
" the yaw angle starts to oscillate. When this happens, the tail will appear "
"to 'wag'. Halve the gain from the value that caused the oscillation."
msgstr ""
"以 0.05 为步长增大 "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_DAMP<YAW2SRV_DAMP>`，直到偏航角开始振荡。发生这种情况时，尾部会出现「摇摆」现象。将导致振荡的值减半作为最终值。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:287
#: 1694533880c64da0982806b67fbbc2f9
msgid ""
"Now roll the model into and out of turns in both directions. If the model "
"has a tendency to yaw the nose to the outside of the turn, then increase the"
" :ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` gain term in increments of 0.05 from its "
"default value of 1.0. Conversely if the model has a tendency to yaw the nose"
" to the inside of the turn on turn entry, then reduce the "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` gain term in increments of 0.01 from its "
"default value of 1.0. If you have to go outside the range from 0.7 to 1.4, "
"then there is something else that needs to be sorted and you should check "
"that you have performed step 2) correctly and check your airspeed "
"calibration if airspeed is being used."
msgstr ""
"现在将飞机在两个方向上进出转弯。如果飞机有向转弯外侧偏航机头的趋势，以 0.05 为增量从其默认值 1.0 增大 "
":ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` 增益项。反之，如果飞机在进弯时有向转弯内侧偏航机头的趋势，以 0.01 为增量从其默认值"
" 1.0 减小 :ref:`YAW2SRV_RLL<YAW2SRV_RLL>` 增益项。如果需要将值调整到 0.7 至 1.4 "
"范围之外，则可能存在其他需要解决的问题，应检查步骤 2) 是否正确执行，并检查空速传感器校准（如使用空速）。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:299
#: d50d6cdc94dd4ca79d233dc680c37f92
msgid "Tuning the sideslip controller"
msgstr "侧滑控制器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:301
#: ebebf7079a5542168bf159a6b73c1013
msgid "Tune the yaw damper first"
msgstr "首先调好偏航阻尼器"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:302
#: 836b6ca85cad44d28e9b1168652d38f1
msgid ""
"Bring up the tuning graph window in the mission planner and plot the lateral"
" acceleration ay."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中打开调参图表窗口，绘制侧向加速度 ay。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:304
#: 0b46eaea6107448694cdad9d68f0eb25
msgid ""
"Roll the model rapidly from full bank in each direction and observe the "
"lateral acceleration ay. If the lateral acceleration sits around zero and "
"doesn't change when you roll into or out of turns then no side-slip control "
"is necessary. You can finish at this point."
msgstr "快速将飞机从每个方向的最大坡度滚转，观察侧向加速度 ay。如果侧向加速度保持在零附近，在进出转弯时不变化，则不需要侧滑控制。可以在此结束。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:308
#: 4602b205f7784a47869cb4cdd601b9d8
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` gain term to 1.0. If this causes the"
" yaw angle to oscillate then halve the gain from the smallest value that "
"causes oscillation."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`YAW2SRV_INT<YAW2SRV_INT>` 增益项设为 1.0。如果这导致偏航角震荡，则从导致震荡的最小值减半增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:311
#: f7c2f3b8e94f445391a41da076d044a2
msgid ""
"If you see that the y acceleration is offset or spikes up during turns, then"
" progressively increase the :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` gain in steps "
"of 0.5 until the error goes away or the yaw angle starts to oscillate. If "
"yaw oscillation occurs, then halve the gain from the value at which caused "
"the oscillation."
msgstr ""
"如果您看到 y 加速度有偏移或在转弯时出现峰值，则以 0.5 为步长逐步增大 :ref:`YAW2SRV_SLIP<YAW2SRV_SLIP>` "
"增益，直到误差消失或偏航角开始震荡。如果发生偏航震荡，则从导致震荡的值减半增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/new-roll-and-pitch-tuning.rst:318
#: f5dfbe51f9854d8ca4cd504fd47072c2
msgid "Yaw Controller Diagram"
msgstr "偏航控制器图"
